{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_14_level_main_14-03_end",
  "groupId": "main_14",
  "stageId": "main_14-03",
  "title": "通讯静默解除",
  "storyCode": "14-4",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_14-03_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "7cd4fd3a92f6221f03c2597886e2808396f037f5b2e4b9af80375aa89112a587",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "50_g16_scourgeswamp"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狙击干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "队长，衍射仪的传感器可能出问题了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......没坏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "术师干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "我就说吧维克多，我的检查结果也是这样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "术师干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "显示不了有效数据，也不一定是仪器出了错，有可能是数据本身超出了区间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "术师干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "嗯，源石反应指标，大于......预设上限。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "各位，敌人已经围上来了，我们还有三分钟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "术师干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "维克多年龄最小，我们要是用上所有办法，应该还能给他争取一个逃生机会......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狙击干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "小易，你以为我申请参加伦蒂尼姆行动，是为了谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "术师干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "你这家伙，真是从来都不听劝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "可露希尔，你那边的情况怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我还活着，没关系的，我的无人机上可是装了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "我好像听到了无人机坠毁的声音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "在以前，那些无人机可都是你的宝贝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "术师干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "队长啊，你让自救军撤退的时候，就知道了吧？那是最后的窗口期了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "源石活动数据还没有拟合完毕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我需要......各位的数据。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "可露希尔，阿米娅不在，你就是我的队长。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "在来伦蒂尼姆之前，我们每一个人都和阿米娅聊过的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "阻止战争，同时拯救维多利亚人和萨卡兹？说真的，就靠我们，这该有多难啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "可我还是选择相信你们，相信......罗德岛的理想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "哪个罗德岛干员不想看见矿石病被治好，大家的日子过得越来越好的那一天？这在大多数人眼里不也是笑话吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "非要说......死在这里，我真觉得有点亏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狙击干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "小易，收到我的数据了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "术师干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "收到了。队长，新一批的数据传给你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "术师干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "哦对，我也没那么无私......发论文的时候带一下我的名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“通讯异常，通讯异常，正在失去信号。”\n“能量波动数据传入，自动分析模块启动。”\n“天灾规模已确定，开始计算未来二十四小时内源石环境模拟演变趋势......”\n......\n“滋滋滋......队长，防护罩......损坏......”\n“他们......正在......”\n“小易......坚持......我正在向你移动......滋滋滋......”\n“滋滋滋——”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“可露希尔，加油。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我会的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "工程师死死地盯着眼前的操作屏幕。\n快一些，再快一些。如果不能将这片战场的源石活动数据拟合完毕，小队所有的努力都会白费。\n在她四周，战争的咆哮正越来越近。\n无人机所剩无几，她已经能感觉到敌人冰冷的呼吸。\n“......模型拟合成功。”\n“正在输出安全区位置——”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "终于，成功了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "接下来，只要竖起通讯塔——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灵幛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1331_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......血魔。叛徒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灵幛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1331_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "战争不会停止，你会成为养料。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好险！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "无人机——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "刚刚升空的无人机被“灵幛”的剑锋劈过，哀鸣着坠毁在地。\n那是她的最后一架战斗无人机。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "该死，别挡路！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灵幛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1331_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可笑的法术，羸弱的法术。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灵幛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1331_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么会有如你一般弱小的血魔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "疼！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "剧痛袭来，可露希尔感觉自己的半边身体一瞬间就麻木了。\n腐败的气息正钻进她的身体。\n可露希尔几乎已经握不住手上的通讯信号塔，她只能勉强把这复杂的设备插在地上，支撑着自己的身体。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“通讯强度不足，设备受干扰程度——高。无法广播安全区位置。”\n“请按设置说明——”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "闭嘴，我知道！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可露希尔，你不是血魔吗，修复伤口啊！多扛一会，至少再久一点点......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要把这玩意竖起来——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（不要辜负......不能辜负......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（不想对不起所有人......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（还有自己。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "可露希尔感觉到，“灵幛”冰冷的手，已经抚上自己的脖子。\n她已经被战争淹没了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可露希尔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁还活着？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "信号......通讯信号在亮......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "罗德岛的信号。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_1036_fang2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可露希尔，抓住我的手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......杜宾？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "50_g16_scourgeswamp"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1036_fang2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1036_fang2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有力气吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "芬......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灵幛”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1331_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一柄小巧的匕首洞穿了“灵幛”的胸膛，巨大的能量随即爆发而出。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，来晚了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1036_fang2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多亏Misery先生通知了我们位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1036_fang2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别担心，更多人在路上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快，还差一点，掩护我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "挡住他们！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我们的使命究竟是什么？在刚加入还叫巴别塔的罗德岛时，可露希尔曾向不止一个人问出过这个问题。\n在那时，每个人的答案都各不相同。\n有人的理想很远大，有人的愿望却很渺小。\n有人说得很具体，有人却只是支支吾吾，最后挠挠头，露出一个微笑。\n但在某种时刻，所有的人都会露出一样的表情。\n在某种时刻，所有的人都会做出一样的选择。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "差的这最后一点点......补上了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“核心模块上线，通讯恢复。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "50_g16_scourgeswamp"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "达格达",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可露希尔，我们来了！坚持住！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费斯特",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们向典范军同步了你们的位置，支援马上就到！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "终于——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1036_fang2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，可露希尔，可露希尔，你还好吗——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "50_g16_scourgeswamp"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "注意和敌人拉开距离，给炮兵队和弩手提供支援。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "食腐者的出现和天灾关联紧密，不要怕他们的巫术，看起来再古怪，也是一种源石技艺！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "记住我们这一路是怎样在天灾中行军的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们能扛住天灾，也能抵御住这帮萨卡兹！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......风笛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯嗯？我在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "高多汀公爵说得没错，“风暴突击队”......本来就是议会直属的部队。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "听从议会的命令，是我们的职责。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这比公爵的邀请......更具有正当性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "更不必说，答应他的话，你、罗本，还有许多不得已跟着我们行动的残兵，所有人的身份问题都能得到解决。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "身份问题？队长，你忘了吗，我本来就退役了呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且......你刚刚站在推进之王身前架起盾的时候，可是一点犹豫都没有欸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们说啊，推进之王带着诸王之息......队长，你见过诸王之息吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "见过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_229_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "推进之王说得对，那只是一根有些意义的“铁条”而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "达格达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "推进之王，有队伍正在迅速从侧翼接近......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......他们没有识别码，但我认得出来，是高多汀公爵的步兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们开始正式与萨卡兹交战......并且，刚刚掩护了我们的一支小队。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果这是高多汀“交朋友”的方法，那我们也会给予同等的回报。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "典范军全员，与高多汀的军队协同作战——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "直到最后一个敌人被打退为止！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "50_g13_warshipcommandroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高级军官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_409_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "公爵阁下，高速军舰已经起航，我们已经暂时脱离危险。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高多汀公爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1068_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "挺好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高多汀公爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1068_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萨卡兹使用的巫术确实千奇百怪。与其让他们不断地骚扰我们的后方，还不如......露出点破绽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高级军官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_409_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "从作战情况来看，“食腐者”的头领，还有其他已知的拥有强大作战能力的萨卡兹并没有现身此处。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高多汀公爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1068_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，在他们眼里，高多汀的威胁性，大概远不及温德米尔和威灵顿吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高多汀公爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1068_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这倒是......值得庆幸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高级军官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_409_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阁下，诸王之息仍未离开吉布森镇。是否启动后续计划？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高多汀公爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1068_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你怎么看？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高级军官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_409_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比预想中的要多花一些功夫，亚历山德莉娜的队伍在逐渐壮大，作战能力也比先前估计的要强一些......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高多汀公爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1068_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，我问的并不是作为对手的看法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高多汀公爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1068_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“典范军”......你也说了，他们打得有模有样的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高多汀公爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1068_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们和我们留下的那些部队的协同，也还不错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高多汀公爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1068_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "丽塔和他们待在一块儿，看起来还真比她爸爸更像传说中的白狼。温德米尔家的小姑娘也没情报里那么娇弱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高多汀公爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1068_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "年轻人们想当英雄典范，说不定啊，真不是玩笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高级军官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_409_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您的意思是，放弃由我们来护送国剑的想法？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高多汀公爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1068_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，怎么能说成放弃呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高多汀公爵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1068_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然高多汀重视的是将来，那以后的路上，“亚历山德莉娜”“诸王之息”“典范军”，甚至“罗德岛”......都未必不会与我们同行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "43_g9_campedchariot"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "达格达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我们的战车正在镇子东面和最后一批萨卡兹交战。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "达格达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "吉布森镇算是守住了。这里可以被当作通往银石崖前线的补给点，但是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "地形变了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“阿喃那”在不断地改变伦蒂尼姆周边的环境。本不该存在的地裂、山崖、湍流，到处都是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "达格达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "银石崖一带几乎每时每刻都在发生剧烈的天灾。我们接下来的每一步会踩在哪里，都难以预料。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说真的，要不是我知道罗德岛的情报不可能出错，我都不敢相信这是我们的伦蒂尼姆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "田野的微风弥漫温暖♪♫朝阳照耀我们的家♬♪......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恐怕到时候，就连国歌的歌词都得变一变了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你还有心情开玩笑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“打回去再考虑”，你一定想说这个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可就算我们真的回去了......我们的家还能回到以前的样子吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我们不仅要赢得这场战争。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们还不能看着萨卡兹......用战争彻底毁掉伦蒂尼姆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前面的风暴，我们会闯过去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "风暴碾过的家园，我们也不能放弃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刚刚费斯特已经跟我说过了，他的小队在附近收到了更多求救信号，希望能救出更多人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "吉布森镇上，与食腐者交战过的区域也需要特殊处理，罗德岛干员会一如既往地提供帮助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我需要我们的人一起完成这些后方的工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "搭建补给线，搜救和转移伤员，集结更多愿意加入我们的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "43_g9_campedchariot"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "维娜，跟着我们去前线的队伍已集结完毕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "加上那些被抹去识别码的高多汀士兵，典范军的规模已经远远超过一个团。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们打算加入我们？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，我去见了那支队伍里的军官们，他们声称在他们登上运输舰之前，高多汀公爵就已经离开了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "从我们的初步接触结果来看，他留下的这支队伍，全都由感染者组成。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "似曾相识，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和他的同僚一样，高多汀公爵也抛下了感染者士兵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......又或者......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "又或者，他故意筛选了一批不幸感染的战士，把他们送到我们的队伍里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我猜他的确不怀好意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "从高多汀的军队在吉布森镇的表现来看，这批感染者士兵和我们过去遇见的那些不一样，很难被称为“残兵”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "假如高多汀的目的是跟踪、监视我们，那我们最好想办法把这群人甩开。实在甩不开，就在战术上隔离......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "戴菲恩，你比我更懂大公爵的手段。我明白，你的猜测极有可能是正确的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但眼下我们正是需要团结的时候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果连典范军都会筛选哪一部分维多利亚是该被“团结”的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我们希冀的未来，又怎么可能成立呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "高多汀很可能就是料到了典范军无法拒绝接纳那些战士，才轻易放我们离开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就做好应对的准备。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们这一路，还会遇到很多挑战。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萨卡兹，“阿喃那”......还有开斯特，以及其他大公爵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "典范军要闯过的“风暴”，不可能只有一种。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。我会通知希勒少尉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4110_delphn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其实，有新人加入，大家都是高兴大于担忧的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，他们都是感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果他们真的没有被高多汀抛弃......这难道不也值得我们高兴吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_112_siege_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不可能发生的“联合”，在未来，说不定会变成现实。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "50_g16_scourgeswamp"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "痛苦的难民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......能遇到像你们一样的人，真是奇迹啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1036_fang2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "女士，“奇迹”不是我们带来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1036_fang2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们直到最后一刻都没有放弃，这才创造了属于你们自己的“奇迹”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "痛苦的难民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不管您怎么说，都请让我好好感谢您吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "痛苦的难民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的身体还撑得住，我会帮您一起安置更需要帮助的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "痛苦的难民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您也能稍微休息一下......仔细看看，您也就和我的孩子差不多大啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1036_fang2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在去下一个地点实施救援之前，我们可以休整十分钟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1036_fang2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......可露希尔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再多给我一点时间......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1036_fang2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你握着的通讯施术单元够完美了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1036_fang2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算Raidian和Mechanist见了，也很难再提出什么改进意见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......接下来的源石环境还会更恶劣。我做得更好一点，你们就能更安全一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1036_fang2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1036_fang2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "吉布森镇附近的搜救工作已接近尾声。接下来我们会去搜索......你的工程小队最后失踪的地点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1036_fang2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "无论这几位干员是否牺牲，我们都会去一一确认。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1036_fang2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "埋在沙暴中、被源石吞噬......都不会毫无痕迹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1036_fang2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们找到他们，带着他们，或者他们的遗物回家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "芬，虽然我清楚自己的想法......但我也想听听更多人的心里话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一个与眼前战争双方都无关的罗德岛干员，为了萨卡兹和维多利亚人之间的战争而牺牲......是不是真的很遗憾？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1036_fang2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "任何任务，只要有牺牲，都很遗憾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1036_fang2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ace大哥牺牲之后，米格鲁抱着他的盾哭了好几夜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1036_fang2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么偏偏是他，会在那个时间那个地点离开？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我也每一次都有这种感觉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，我想知道的......是牺牲者的感受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1036_fang2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......自己的遗憾，肯定也会有吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1036_fang2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们都不是不怕死的圣人。可露希尔，你也不是。所以你会为之前的决定感到痛苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1036_fang2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，作为参加本次支援行动的人，我不后悔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1036_fang2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪怕不说为了炎熔和芙蓉，或者其他萨卡兹朋友，只是为了这些未曾谋面的人，我也愿意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1036_fang2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让我从哥伦比亚来到罗德岛的，就是一场天灾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1036_fang2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "从那个时候我就知道，灾难落到每个人头上的时候，并不会区分我们谁是谁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1036_fang2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天我来到这里，是因为我知道，当我的故乡和我在意的人陷入危难的时候，你们也会来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，我们一定会来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
